From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vincent Leon <leon@mbp.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 22:40:51 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 12/14] feat(app): offer 24 and 48 hour windows for finished
 work

The Done within row in activity grouping now lists 24 hours and 48 hours
after Today. Both are rolling windows counted back from now, so work
finished yesterday afternoon can stay under Done the next morning, which
Today drops at midnight.

The persisted sidebar view schema accepts the new values; a value the
schema rejected would discard the whole saved view.
